# Route: guide 2 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 11 to
# 15, 71 quests, 3.4 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Elwynn Forest): Goldshire -> Crystal Lake -> Goldshire -> Fargodeep
# Mine -> Forest's Edge -> Fargodeep Mine -> Goldshire -> Crystal Lake ->
# Goldshire -> Northshire Valley -> Tower of Azora -> Northshire Valley ->
# Goldshire -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Big Picture (91752;
# Shinyfinder Narf 3); Book Return (91775; Nimsy 6); Wanted:  "Hogger" (176;
# Hogger 11); Rare Books (91777; Geosculptor Yip 7, Mother Fang 7-10);
# Croaky's Head (91740; Croaky 11); Elmpaw's Head (91746; Elmpaw 12).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 91751 Rough
# Wolf Pelts; 91753 An Enchanting Lesson; 97915 Camping 101: Alchemy; 97916
# Camping 101: Blacksmithing; 97917 Camping 101: Enchanting; 97918 Camping
# 101: Engineering; 97919 Camping 101: First Aid; 97920 Camping 101: Fishing;
# 97921 Camping 101: Herbalism; 97922 Camping 101: Leatherworking; 97923
# Camping 101: Mining; 97924 Camping 101: Skinning; 97925 Camping 101:
# Tailoring.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category).

